# Per-environment configuration and secrets are never committed.
# Copy the matching *.example.env file and fill it in, or let CI materialise them
# from GitHub secrets (see the deploy job in .github/workflows/staging.yml).
#
# Scoped to overlays on purpose: deploy/base/config.env holds the shared,
# non-secret defaults and must stay committed.
overlays/*/config.env
overlays/*/secrets.env
